[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3062.23, "timestamp": "00:51:02", "text": "蜇。所以，Sting就像一颗覆盆子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3064.95, "timestamp": "00:51:04", "text": "带有风味的荷林填充型饮料。相同的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3066.39, "timestamp": "00:51:06", "text": "有眼镜蛇的味道，但不是草莓味的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3068.15, "timestamp": "00:51:08", "text": "调味的。嗯，他们确实有草莓味的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3070.79, "timestamp": "00:51:10", "text": "味道，但通常只是一种奇怪的味道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3074.069, "timestamp": "00:51:14", "text": "颜色怪异的尿色。我甚至都不认识"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3075.67, "timestamp": "00:51:15", "text": "知道那是什么口味的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3077.95, "timestamp": "00:51:17", "text": "这是尿液的颜色。这就是全部内容了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3080.309, "timestamp": "00:51:20", "text": "记住。我刚才喝了伯爵茶，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3081.23, "timestamp": "00:51:21", "text": "现在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3083.99, "timestamp": "00:51:23", "text": "好的。坦白说，我不是……我不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3086.71, "timestamp": "00:51:26", "text": "卖茶的。我喜欢覆盆子茶。我已经有了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3089.67, "timestamp": "00:51:29", "text": "之前喝过覆盆子茶，我还喝过牛至茶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3093.27, "timestamp": "00:51:33", "text": "茶。我喜欢那些。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3095.589, "timestamp": "00:51:35", "text": "但我并不一定非要寻找"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3097.75, "timestamp": "00:51:37", "text": "一开始就直接攻击他们。我喜欢它们，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3099.67, "timestamp": "00:51:39", "text": "它们并不是我的首选，或者说，它们并不是我喜欢的类型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3102.63, "timestamp": "00:51:42", "text": "买饮料的首选。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3104.23, "timestamp": "00:51:44", "text": "嗯。此外，我们这里饮料价格便宜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3107.03, "timestamp": "00:51:47", "text": "总之。就像我们可以得到一个大的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3110.47, "timestamp": "00:51:50", "text": "比如花一美元就能买到一杯饮料。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3112.95, "timestamp": "00:51:52", "text": "那真不错。你知道那些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3117.51, "timestamp": "00:51:57", "text": "那种奇怪的快闪珍珠奶茶之类的东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3119.109, "timestamp": "00:51:59", "text": "是的。我通常都从那里买。"}]